{"ticker":"DHR","updated":"2026-10-23T22:52:00Z","profile":{"longName":"Danaher Corporation","shortName":"Danaher Corporation","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Diagnostics & Research","country":"United States","website":"https://www.danaher.com","fullTimeEmployees":58000,"marketCap":162038284288,"trailingPE":38.16225,"forwardPE":24.750587,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.3276434,"pegRatio":1.38,"targetMeanPrice":259.1905,"targetHighPrice":310.0,"targetLowPrice":205.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.083,"earningsGrowth":0.378,"grossMargins":0.59360003,"operatingMargins":0.21132,"profitMargins":0.16913,"totalRevenue":25607999488,"beta":0.797,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":242.8,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":160.93,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.7},"summary":"Danaher Corporation designs, manufactures, and markets professional, medical, research, and industrial products and services in the United States, China, and internationally. The company operates through Biotechnology, Life Sciences, and Diagnostics segments. The Biotechnology segment provides technologies, consumables, services, and solutions that advance, accelerate, and integrate the development and manufacture of therapeutics; cell line and cell culture media development services; cell culture media, process liquids and buffers for manufacturing, chromatography resins, filtration technologies, and aseptic fill finish; single-use hardware, consumables, and services, such as the design and installation of full manufacturing suites; lab filtration, separation, and purification; lab-scale protein purification and analytical tools; reagents, membranes, and services for diagnostic and assay development; and healthcare filtration solutions. The Life Sciences segment provides mass spectrometers; bioanalytical measurement systems; flow cytometry, genomics, lab automation, centrifugation, liquid handling automation instruments, antibodies and reagents, and particle counting and characterization; genome sample preparation; microscopes; protein consumables; filtration products; and genomic medicines, such as custom nucleic acid products, and plasmid DNA, RNA, and proteins under the ABC","summary_zh":"丹納赫公司在美國、中國和國際上設計、製造和銷售專業、醫療、研究和工業產品及服務。該公司透過生物技術、生命科學和診斷部門運作。生物技術部門提供技術、消耗品、服務和解決方案，以推進、加速和整合治療藥物的開發和製造；細胞系和細胞培養基開發服務；細胞培養基、生產用工藝液體和緩衝液、色譜樹脂、過濾技術和無菌灌裝；一次性硬體、消耗品和服務，例如完整製造套件的設計和安裝；實驗室過濾、分離和純化實驗室；生命科學部門提供質譜儀；生物分析測量系統；流式細胞術、基因組學、實驗室自動化、離心、液體處理自動化儀器、抗體和試劑以及顆粒計數和表徵；基因組樣本製備；顯微鏡；蛋白質消耗品；過濾產品；和基因組藥物，例如 ABC 下的定制核酸產品、質粒 DNA、RNA 和蛋白質","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"診斷與研究","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":211.3,"h":211.73,"l":207.29,"c":207.73,"v":1985800},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":207.78,"h":209.36,"l":205.67,"c":206.25,"v":3670600},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":205.64,"h":207.39,"l":203.8,"c":205.0,"v":2503200},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":204.47,"h":205.68,"l":202.02,"c":205.29,"v":2519900},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":205.34,"h":207.7,"l":204.7,"c":205.82,"v":1979800},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":204.56,"h":206.0,"l":200.68,"c":203.79,"v":2389000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":202.78,"h":204.04,"l":198.68,"c":199.44,"v":3468200},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":198.9,"h":199.79,"l":192.18,"c":199.03,"v":3673600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":199.43,"h":203.88,"l":198.63,"c":200.21,"v":2837600},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":195.67,"h":198.95,"l":194.34,"c":198.63,"v":3502100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":198.63,"h":199.15,"l":193.39,"c":194.33,"v":3345100},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":194.05,"h":196.93,"l":192.37,"c":192.59,"v":5509500},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":194.7,"h":196.22,"l":193.47,"c":195.16,"v":3426200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":195.0,"h":195.0,"l":188.86,"c":190.05,"v":3899900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":191.06,"h":191.57,"l":187.04,"c":188.54,"v":4675400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":189.0,"h":192.07,"l":187.76,"c":190.47,"v":4817600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":191.21,"h":196.33,"l":190.73,"c":192.94,"v":4419300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":193.9,"h":196.15,"l":193.3,"c":195.27,"v":2871800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":196.17,"h":19