e sciences and diagnostics sectors, organized under three segments (Biotechnology, Life Sciences and Diagnostics). United by the DANAHER BUSINESS SYSTEM (\"DBS\"), our businesses are also typically characterized by a high level of products and services that are sold on a recurring basis, primarily through a direct sales model and to a geographically diverse customer base. Our business' research and development, manufacturing, sales, distribution, service and administrative facilities are located in approximately 50 countries.","zh":"丹納赫是全球科技創新者，致力於加速科技力量改善人類健康。丹納赫由超過 15 家在生物技術、生命科學和診斷領域處於領先地位的營運公司組成，分為三個部門（生物技術、生命科學和診斷）。我們的業務由丹納赫業務系統（「DBS」）聯合起來，其特點還在於提供高水準的產品和服務，主要透過直銷模式向不同地域的客戶群進行定期銷售。我們的業務研發、製造、銷售、分銷、服務和行政設施遍佈約 50 個國家。"},{"en":"Danaher measures its progress against these strategic priorities over the long-term based primarily on financial metrics relating to revenue growth, profitability, cash flow and capital returns, as well as certain non-financial metrics. To further the strategic objectives set forth above, the Company also acquires businesses and makes investments that either complement its existing business portfolio or expand its portfolio into new markets that the Company deems attractive. Given the rapid pace of technological development and the specialized expertise typical of Danaher's served markets, acquisitions as well as strategic alliances and investments can provide the Company access to important new technologies and domain expertise, and Danaher continues to pursue acquisition and investment opportunities within its targeted markets. The extent to which we identify, consummate and effectivel","zh":"丹納赫主要根據與收入成長、獲利能力、現金流和資本回報相關的財務指標以及某些非財務指標來衡量這些策略重點的長期進展。為了進一步實現上述策略目標，公司還收購業務並進行投資，以補充其現有業務組合或將其投資組合擴展到公司認為有吸引力的新市場。鑑於技術發展的快速步伐以及丹納赫所服務市場的典型專業知識，收購以及策略聯盟和投資可以使公司獲得重要的新技術和領域專業知識，並且丹納赫將繼續在其目標市場中尋求收購和投資機會。我們辨識、完善和有效的程度"},{"en":"DBS is not only the set of business processes and tools our operating companies use on a daily basis in the pursuit of continuous improvement, but also represents our culture, which is guided by the following core values (the \"Core Values\"):","zh":"星展銀行不僅是我們的營運公司為追求持續改進而日常使用的一套業務流程和工具，而且代表了我們的文化，該文化以以下核心價值（「核心價值」）為指導："}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Sales in 2025 by geographic destination (geographic destination refers to the geographic area where the final sale to the Company's unaffiliated customer is made) and by revenue type (revenue type refers to categorizing the Company's products between those typically sold to a customer on a recurring basis and those typically sold to a customer on a nonrecurring basis) as a percentage of total 2025 sales were:","zh":"按地理目的地（地理目的地是指最終向公司非關聯客戶進行最終銷售的地理區域）和收入類型（收入類型是指將公司的產品分為通常定期銷售給客戶的產品和通常銷售給客戶的非經常性產品）的 2025 年銷售額佔 2025 年總銷售額的百分比為："}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Diagnostics","val":9941000000,"zh":"診斷部門"},{"name":"Life Sciences","val":7334000000,"zh":"生命科學部門"},{"name":"Biotechnology","val":7293000000,"zh":"生物科技部門"}],"total":24568000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Revenuefrom Contractwith Customer Measurement Recurring","val":20127000000,"zh":"與客戶定期測量的合約收入"},{"name":"Revenuefrom Contractwith Customer Measurement Nonrecurring","val":4441000000,"zh":"與客戶簽訂的合約收入計量非經常性"}],"total":24568000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":10356000000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"High Growth Markets","val":7022000000,"zh":"高成長市場"},{"name":"Western Europe","val":5938000000,"zh":"西歐"},{"name":"Other Developed Markets","val":1252000000,"zh":"其他已開發市場"}],"total":24568000000}},"peers":["TMO","SYK","BDX","ZTS","ECL"]}}